{"id":"2ffc718feb66a857","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures.md","title":"ZFC CI Localization Slalom Captures","display":"df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures — ZFC CI Localization Slalom Captures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures — ZFC CI Localization Slalom Captures","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures — ZFC CI Localization Slalom Captures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,f\\in V\">\\(s,f\\in V\\)</span> (candidate localization slalom and real)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate from dependency)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationSlalomCaptures}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationSlalomCaptures}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom}\\vdash\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S(s)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(|s(n)|\\leq n+1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom}\\vdash\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S(s)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(|s(n)|\\leq n+1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom\\text{-}captures}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationSlalomCaptures}_S(s,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S(s)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in s(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom\\text{-}captures}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationSlalomCaptures}_S(s,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S(s)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in s(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The width convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s(n)|\\leq n+1\">\\(|s(n)|\\leq n+1\\)</span> avoids a forced empty zeroth coordinate; replacing it by another fixed unbounded width function gives the corresponding parameterized localization notion.</li>\n<li>Algebraic localization and finite partial-function slaloms are different notions and are not dependencies of this predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationSlalomCaptures}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom}\\vdash\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S(s)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,[\\omega]^{<\\omega})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(|s(n)|\\leq n+1\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom\\text{-}captures}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCiLocalizationSlalomCaptures}_S(s,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LocalizationSlalom}_S(s)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in s(n))","display":true},{"tex":"|s(n)|\\leq n+1","display":false}],"bytes":1920,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1615","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures.md|58-df-zfc-ci-localization-slalom-captures]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}